### Jaya Abadi — contoh REST Client (VS Code) / IntelliJ HTTP client
### Jalankan server dulu: npm run dev (folder server/)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api

### 0. Health check (tanpa login)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1. Login — respons berisi Set-Cookie "token" + meta.token
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@jayaabadi.co.id",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Salin nilai token dari field meta.token di respons login ke variabel di bawah
@token = GANTI_DENGAN_TOKEN

### 2. Profil saya (butuh token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/me
Cookie: token={{token}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Logout — menghapus cookie
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout

### 4. Ganti password sendiri (butuh token)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/auth/change-password
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Admin123!",
  "newPassword": "PasswordBaru123"
}

### 5. Login dengan kredensial salah → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@jayaabadi.co.id",
  "password": "salah123"
}

### 6. Validasi gagal: bukan email → 400 + daftar errors
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "bukan-email",
  "password": ""
}

### ===== USERS (khusus SUPER_ADMIN) =====

### 7. Daftar user + paginasi + pencarian
GET {{baseUrl}}/users?page=1&limit=10&search=admin
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 8. Buat user baru → 201
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Budi Editor",
  "email": "budi@jayaabadi.co.id",
  "password": "Password123",
  "role": "EDITOR"
}

### 9. Update user — ganti nama + role (ganti :id dengan id user)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/:id
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Budi Editor Senior",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### 10. Aktifkan / nonaktifkan user (toggle)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/:id/toggle-status
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 11. Hapus user (akses ditolak 400 jika id = diri sendiri)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/:id
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 12. Akses users tanpa login → 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### 13. Akses users dengan role bukan SUPER_ADMIN → 403
### (login dulu sebagai user ber-role EDITOR/ADMIN, contoh budi)
# POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login  { "email": "budi@jayaabadi.co.id", "password": "Password123" }
GET {{baseUrl}}/users
Cookie: token=TokenMilikEditor

### ===== MEDIA (butuh login) =====

### 14. Upload 1+ file — field "files" (JPG/PNG/WebP, maks 5 MB per file).
### Ganti path setelah `<` dengan file sungguhan di komputer Anda.
POST {{baseUrl}}/media/upload
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=BoundaryForm

--BoundaryForm
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="contoh.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./uploads/.gitkeep
--BoundaryForm--
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="contoh.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./path/ke/file.png
--BoundaryForm--

### 15. Daftar media + paginasi + pencarian nama file
GET {{baseUrl}}/media?page=1&limit=10&search=contoh
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 16. Hapus media (record + file fisik) — ganti :id dengan id media
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/media/:id
Cookie: token={{token}}

### 17. Upload tanpa login → 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/media/upload

### Dashboard — statistik admin (butuh token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard
Cookie: token={{token}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Proyek — daftar (filter & paginasi opsional)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/projects?page=1&limit=10&status=ONGOING
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Proyek — detail
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/projects/GANTI_ID
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Proyek — buat
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/projects
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pembangunan Jembatan Desa Sukamaju",
  "summary": "Jembatan beton bentang 40 meter penghubung dua dusun.",
  "description": "Pembangunan jembatan beton bertulang dengan fondasi bore pile. Durasi pengerjaan 8 bulan termasuk pendekian tanah.",
  "location": "Kab. Bandung",
  "clientName": "Pemerintah Desa Sukamaju",
  "year": 2026,
  "value": "Rp 4,5 M",
  "status": "ONGOING",
  "categoryId": "GANTI_ID_KATEGORI",
  "coverImage": "/uploads/contoh.jpg",
  "isPublished": true,
  "images": []
}

### Proyek — update (partial)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/projects/GANTI_ID
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "COMPLETED" }

### Proyek — toggle publish / featured
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/projects/GANTI_ID/publish
Cookie: token={{token}}

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/projects/GANTI_ID/featured
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Proyek — hapus
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/projects/GANTI_ID
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Layanan — daftar
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/services
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Layanan — buat
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/services
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Renovasi Rumah",
  "shortDesc": "Renovasi menyeluruh atau parsial hunian Anda.",
  "description": "Layanan renovasi mencakup perbaikan struktur, pengecatan, pergantian atap, hingga penataan ulang ruangan sesuai kebutuhan klien.",
  "icon": "Hammer",
  "image": null,
  "isPublished": true
}

### Layanan — update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/services/GANTI_ID
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "shortDesc": "Deskripsi singkat baru." }

### Layanan — reorder (urutan id hasil tombol naik/turun)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/services/reorder
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ids": ["ID_B", "ID_A", "ID_C"] }

### Layanan — hapus
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/services/GANTI_ID
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Hero slide — buat (maks 5 aktif)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/hero-slides
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Bangun Bersama Jaya Abadi", "subtitle": "Kontraktor terpercaya sejak 1998", "image": "/uploads/hero.jpg", "ctaLabel": "Hubungi Kami", "ctaUrl": "/kontak", "isActive": true }

### Hero slide — update / hapus
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/hero-slides/GANTI_ID
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isActive": false }

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/hero-slides/GANTI_ID
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Pesan publik — form kontak (honeypot 'website' harus kosong)
POST {{baseUrl}}/public/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Budi", "email": "budi@example.com", "phone": "081234567890", "subject": "Tanya Renovasi", "body": "Saya ingin tanya estimasi renovasi rumah 2 lantai.", "website": "" }

### Pesan admin — daftar / belum dibaca / detail / tandai / hapus
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/messages?unread=true&page=1
Cookie: token={{token}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/messages/unread-count
Cookie: token={{token}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/messages/GANTI_ID
Cookie: token={{token}}

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/messages/GANTI_ID/read
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isRead": false }

DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/messages/GANTI_ID
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Settings — admin & publik
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/settings
Cookie: token={{token}}

PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/settings
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "company_name": "Jaya Abadi", "company_tagline": "Membangun kepercayaan", "company_whatsapp": "6281234567890" }

GET {{baseUrl}}/public/settings
